From 837b71146bdd13ceac59d76cfe1f2572d58117b3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Manikanta Kanamarlapudi <kmanikan@codeaurora.org>
Date: Wed, 15 Jul 2026 21:11:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 09/13] [upstream] libavextensions: import CLO AV extensions
 framework

Import the Qualcomm/CLO AVExtensions framework (media/libavextensions/):
static libs libavextensions (AVFactory/AVUtils/ExtendedMediaDefs),
libavmediaextentions (AVMediaUtils) and libavmediaserviceextensions
(AVMediaServiceFactory/AVNuFactory/AVNuUtils). Stock AOSP frameworks/av
lacks these; the OEM Oplus AV-enhancement chain (libavenhancements ->
liboplusavenhancements -> OplusCCodec) imports their symbols.

Provenance: CLO platform/frameworks/av. Foundational commit ef5997b09c
"stagefright: Make classes customizable and add AV extensions" (Manikanta
Kanamarlapudi, 2018-01-18); imported at tip 47c53dbf06 (2026-07-03). This
subtree is the cumulative state of 53 CLO commits (2018->2026); a literal
per-commit cherry-pick replay onto this A16 tree is not clean (8 years of
cross-file divergence in the shared files those commits also touch), so it
is imported at tip state with the original authorship preserved (--author)
and provenance cited here. Purely additive: no existing file is modified.

Note: commits 1-4 of this series are provenance-layering (the raw upstream
import); they are not individually buildable on A16. Build-verification
lands at [OURS] commit 5 (static libs compile), commits 6-8 (libstagefright/
libmediaplayerservice/codec2 wiring + symbol export) and the series tip,
all under the bp4a release config.

Source: git.codelinaro.org/clo/la/platform/frameworks/av @ 47c53dbf06
Change-Id: I71484d645234cbbf7e627df7919e0b157dd7e629
(cherry picked from commit 2eda64ccafeef64bcc137c37da8157f4fd7e2725)
